Start by rimming the glasses with a lime wedge, then sprinkle with festive salt or sprinkles. Place the glasses in the freezer to set.

In a #pitcher{} add @madhava foods organic light agave{1/2%cup}, @tequila{2%cups}, @orange liqueur{1%cup}, and @lime juice{1%cup, freshly squeezed}. Stir well to combine.

Pour into prepped glasses filled with ice. Top with @champagne{1%oz}, and enjoy!